* Replay of ORIGINAL TI PSpice transient fixture (steady) in ngspice-47
* vendor netlist bytes: UCC28C43_STEADY.net sha256 verbatim component lines
* component lines are transcribed verbatim from the TI-generated .net; only the analysis shell differs:
*   TI .cir .LIB ../../../ucc28c43.lib  ->  .include ucc28c43_trans_unencrypted.lib (identical content, sha in metrics)
*   TI .TRAN/.OPTIONS (PSpice ABSTOL=1u CHGTOL=0.1p GMIN=1e-10 ITL4=5000 RELTOL=0.01 VNTOL=1m)
*     -> ngspice tolerances listed in .options below (ngspice has no CHGTOL)
*   TI V_V1 has NO source specification -> V_V1 VIN 0 24 (explicit assumption, see metrics)
*   TI .IC V(FB )=2.5 -> ngspice .nodeset V(FB)=2.5 (same DC initial operating point guess)
*   PSpice SCHEDULE() has no ngspice equivalent -> fixed max step
*   TI node name '+VOUT1' is not a legal ngspice vector name -> wrdata requests it by index find()
.include ucc28c43_trans_unencrypted.lib
.options reltol=0.01 abstol=1u vntol=1m gmin=1e-10 itl4=5000
.nodeset V(FB)=2.5
